 SGPL (com teste anti-robô), e as listas de mensagens de veto e de projetos publicadas pelo governo estão incompletas."],"notas_en":["Each deputy's bills are not included: the Alems bill system (SGPL) requires an anti-bot test for every query, and this site does not get around such protections. Each bill can be looked up in the SGPL itself, through the Alems website.","Spending: CEAP (the office allowance), from the receipts published on the Alems transparency portal.","Votes are not included: the Alems does not publish each deputy's vote in an open format; in roll-call votes it only appears in the text of each session's transcript (PDF), on its transparency portal.","State government: signed laws are included, from the Mato Grosso do Sul government's state legislation database. Vetoes and the bills the government sent to the state assembly are not: the bills only appear in the SGPL (with an anti-bot test), and the lists of veto messages and bills published by the government are incomplete."],"sic":"https://transparencia2.al.ms.gov.br/home/sic","conferido":"2026-10-28"}},"fonteMunicipios":{"veiculo":"IBGE","titulo":"Códigos e nomes dos municípios (API de localidades)","url":"https://www.ibge.gov.br/explica/codigos-dos-municipios.php","data":"2026-10-29"},"atualizado":"2026-10-29"}
